{"path":"string/basic_string_view/rbegin","title":"std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::rbegin, std::basic_string_view<CharT,Traits>::crbegin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>rbegin, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>crbegin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/rbegin","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reverse iterator to the first character of the reversed view. It corresponds to the last character of the non-reversed view.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reverse_iterator rbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reverse_iterator crbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reverse iterator to the first character of the reversed view. It corresponds to the last character of the non-reversed view.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-rbegin-rend.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/3/39/range-rbegin-rend.svg\" width=\"589\" height=\"250\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return